{"OAuthLoginView uses pipeline.signature as the OAuth state which is a deterministic md5 of view class names, making the state predictable and not tied to user/session, failing to provide CSRF/replay protection": 0.844181478023529, "GitHubInstallation indexes integration.metadata[\"sender\"][\"login\"] directly without checking if sender exists, causing KeyError and 500 errors for older records or records created via non-webhook paths": 0.9608132839202881, "GitHubInstallation returns pipeline.next_step() when no Integration row exists for the installation_id, skipping the new installer validation check and allowing the pipeline to complete without verifying installer identity": 0.37157586216926575, "OAuthLoginView calls safe_urlopen and get_user_info without handling request/HTTP exceptions, causing GitHub outages/timeouts or non-2xx responses to crash the pipeline with 500 errors instead of returning a failure page": 0.9199837446212769}